Fleet load test, read-only, no file writes by anyone. Spawn exactly three subagents in parallel (one message, all at once), using these agent roles by name: `explore-codebase`, `challenger`, `cartographer`. Give each a tiny read-only task: list 3 files under scripts/lib and stop (challenger: also state in one line whether that listing is plausible). Wait for all three, then answer with one line per agent: role name and the 3 files it reported. Do not write or edit any file, do not run git writes.
